## Current Status

The system now contains:

* stable accelerometer pitch estimation
* real elapsed-time gyro integration
* complementary-filter fusion
* structured telemetry output
* long-duration drift testing capability
* significantly improved orientation stability

While drift tuning continues, the overall estimation pipeline now behaves physically and mathematically correctly.
